Package: usb-storage-watch
Version: @VERSION@
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: USB Storage Watch contributors <maintainers@example.invalid>
Depends: python3 (>= 3.10), systemd (>= 249), util-linux (>= 2.37), fdisk, e2fsprogs, mount (>= 2.37), coreutils (>= 8.32), udev, iproute2, usbutils, ca-certificates, hdparm, psmisc, acl, python3-flask (>= 3.0), python3-pam, python3-yaml, openssl, xdg-utils
Description: USB storage monitoring and recovery
 Persistent incidents, authenticated TLS email, optional normal remounting,
 automatically verified isolated software USB reconnect and Docker recovery.
 All automatic mutations default off. Configure before starting the service.
 Authenticated localhost dashboard with an unprivileged web server,
 desktop launcher, safe manual controls and guarded HDD idle standby.
